plugin-hostd (0.20.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * tests: the sibling-checkout sabotage anchors on the checkout, not the
    action refs
  * ci: the organisation from the runner; plugin-db-devel per architecture
  * workflows: run in Open-Mixer while FreeMixer is restricted
  * workflows: run in Open-Mixer while FreeMixer is restricted
  * release, githooks: the plugin-hostd-full checks and the hook checker from
    Open-Mixer
  * workflows: run in Open-Mixer while FreeMixer is restricted
  * tests/full_ranges.py: the panel sabotage plants on the two-line Recommends
  * ci: cancel a pull request's stale runs
  * Release 0.20.1
  * plugin-hostd-full: plugin-qualification-records recommended until it is
    in the channel
  * plugin-hostd-full: depend on plugin-qualification-records by name, on its
    dated version
  * plugin-hostd-full: a synopsis with no leading article (lintian
    description-synopsis-starts-with-article)
  * README: newcomers read docs/groupings.md first
  * docs: how plugins are grouped, a first-read page
  * docs: drawings of the plugin groupings
  * README, guide: install plugin-hostd-full
  * release: plugin-hostd-full installed from the channel, default and
    headless
  * plugin-hostd-full: the whole plugin host stack in one package
  * tests: sabotage arms for the check of what the worker loaded
  * tests: the first-use fixtures declare their directory, and a sabotage arm
  * pins: what the worker loaded must be the file that was hashed
  * test: a binary swapped between the hash and the load is refused
  * pins: first use learns only inside the declared search path
  * test: first use learns no pin outside the declared search path
  * Add a threat model
  * pins: a .clap directory bundle pins its one object, not the directory
    (#160)
  * fuzz: the reply records follow relay.c's lines
  * voices-cores: a failed run names the exit status and the last lines of
    the log (#8)
  * supervisor: a value the plugin moved itself is checkpointed, so a respawn
    keeps it
  * tests: daemon waits end on the daemon's own reply or feedback line, with
    a 60 s ceiling (#8)
  * docs: cite plugin-hostd and omx-contract by their new issue numbers

